2. OPEN DYNAMICS ENGINE

Files under src/ode/, include/ode/, and related locations contain material
corresponding to Open Dynamics Engine (ODE) version 0.5. Historical ODE 0.5
source offered a choice of licenses that included the BSD-style license used
for redistribution of the upstream ODE portions in this repository.

The historical BSD text is reproduced verbatim from the ODE 0.5 release in
LICENSE-BSD.TXT. Existing ODE copyright, authorship, and licensing notices
must be preserved. Redistribution of upstream ODE portions must comply with
the conditions in LICENSE-BSD.TXT, including retention of the notice,
conditions, and disclaimer for source redistribution and reproduction of
them in accompanying documentation and/or other materials for binary
redistribution. The names of ODE's copyright owner and contributors may not
be used to imply endorsement without specific prior written permission.

Some ODE-related files may include changes or additions authored by the
game's developer or another third party. The ODE BSD license applies to the
upstream ODE material; it does not, by itself, establish the licensing status
of independently copyrightable third-party changes or additions.

See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and docs/ode-provenance.md for details.

