4. GAME-DERIVED AND RECONSTRUCTED MATERIAL

This repository is an independently produced source reconstruction based on
analysis of retail versions of the game. It is not an official source-code
release.

Some files reconstruct code, organization, interfaces, constants, names,
behavior, or modifications present in the retail game. Such material may be
subject to third-party rights. Project contributors do not claim ownership of
third-party material and cannot grant permission for rights they do not own.

In particular, the CC0 dedication in LICENSE-CC0.txt does not apply to
copyrightable expression owned by Nintendo, Next Level Games, or another
third party. Inclusion in this repository is not a representation that such
material is in the public domain or that every use or redistribution is
authorized in every jurisdiction.

